"有效克重 = 克重 × 纯度\n总投入 = 裸金单价 × 克重 + 工费 + 其他成本（手动总价优先）\n预计回收单价 = max(参考金价 − 每克扣减, 0) × (1 − 比例折价)\n预计到手 = max(预计回收单价 × 有效克重 − 固定费用, 0)\n真实盈亏 = 预计到手 − 总投入\n真实收益率 = 真实盈亏 ÷ 总投入\n真实保本价 = (总投入 + 固定费用) ÷ [有效克重 × (1 − 折价)] + 每克扣减" = "Effective Weight = Weight × Purity\nTotal Invested = Spot Price × Weight + Craft Fee + Other Costs (manual total takes priority)\nEst. Buyback Price = max(Ref Price − Per-Gram Deduction, 0) × (1 − Pct Discount)\nEst. Proceeds = max(Est. Buyback Price × Effective Weight − Fixed Fee, 0)\nTrue P&L = Est. Proceeds − Total Invested\nTrue Return = True P&L ÷ Total Invested\nTrue Break-even = (Total Invested + Fixed Fee) ÷ [Effective Weight × (1 − Discount)] + Per-Gram Deduction";
